WEBVTT

00:09:59.076 --> 00:10:00.556
"I don't have the experience."

00:10:00.556 --> 00:10:02.436
"I'm not the expert."

00:10:02.436 --> 00:10:04.236
"The system is too broken,

00:10:04.236 --> 00:10:06.436
our leaders too shortsighted,

00:10:06.476 --> 00:10:09.716
our society too shackled
to the status quo."

00:10:10.996 --> 00:10:14.116
These stories paralyze us.

00:10:15.556 --> 00:10:22.076
Rewriting them is the single
most powerful thing anyone of us can do

00:10:22.116 --> 00:10:25.556
for the planet and for ourselves.

00:10:27.076 --> 00:10:29.516
Now ask yourself.